==Strategy==
Not a very difficult stage. However, Master A., in combination with the various obstacles obstructing a clear path to him, can make this tricky. It's best to use units with a low amount of knockbacks and Area Attacks, such as [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]], [[Kung Fu Cat (Special Cat)|Drunken Kung Fu Cat]], Etc. You can easily brute force through the Large Iron Balls with just [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cats]].

